# INVWINQB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the Record menu
# at level 1, a reader.  The entries that change records are grayed on
# the item list, and so on item 1's parts and on the location tree,
# where the others, Open, Parts and Back, still work; a grayed entry
# chosen does nothing, so that no refusal shows and the menu is closed
# (DOWN after the first moves the selection to item 2).  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINQB.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K ALT-C D
K DOWN
S NODEL
K ALT-C M
S NOMOVE
K ALT-C P
S PARTS
K ALT-C T
S NOTAKE
K ALT-C B
S BACK
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
K ALT-C O
S CONTENTS
K ESC ESC
S END
K ALT-F X
